  "description": "Process a keeps the database image (and the observed lock-file state) at: start; inside a transaction after an update; after an ordinary CommitTrans; inside a second transaction; after CommitTrans(dbForceOSFlush); inside two nested levels after an inner CommitTrans(dbForceOSFlush); after the outer Rollback; right after an implicit-commit UPDATE statement; and after DBEngine.Idle(dbRefreshCache). Process b reads row 1 through a new snapshot after the ordinary commit, after the outer rollback and after the implicit update. Asks which images differ at which point; byte interpretation is later work.",
